                        "glosses": [
                            "Something, especially a medication, that is inhaled."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b8ed074-88cc-491f-8a1c-ffb1fd6de2a8",
                                "sense_id": "1c7df8aa-0fd9-3d93-93c0-9f410314169f",
                                "text": "There are three theories about what caused the cardiac arrest, Kramp said: The inhalant could have oversensitized the patient’s heart, which can make any subsequent stress, like getting caught by a parent, cause cardiac arrest. Also, inhalants decrease the strength of contraction of the heart muscle."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ecc7ccc7-a8d0-4d8e-a7da-5c272fd96f96",
                                "sense_id": "1c7df8aa-0fd9-3d93-93c0-9f410314169f",
                                "text": "On social media and beyond, many have taken to using the brand’s name in a more colloquial fashion, with “Galaxy Gas” being used as a catchall for nitrous oxide inhalants at large, regardless of whether they are actually Galaxy Gas products or not."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
